  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Mellow Mama is an aromatherapy brand offering pregnancy safe products to help ease a range of symptoms. During this precious time, let the power of aromatherapy embrace you. We can offer moments of relaxation and tranquility before you welcome your little bundle of joy into the world! Remember a happy and serene mother lays the foundations of a content and healthy newborn.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description: Our products consist of diffuser oils, massage oils, moisturisers, bath soaps, aromatherapy sprays and sniffy pots. We blend essential oils appropriate for each stage in pregnancy to suit specific needs. Our antenatal range can be used at any stage and this can help support back pain, poor sleep, nausea etc. Our labour/ post dates range can help support the onset of labour, regulate contractions, promote mental clarity and focus. We aim to support women to feel relaxed and ready to welcome their little ones into the world.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): We are midwives who are RCM accredited in aromatherapy for childbirth so we know our target audience and their needs extremely well. Our products offer support to help ease unwanted pregnancy symptoms such as back pain, headaches, nausea, poor sleep, tiredness, lack of focus and cramps. All our Mellow Mama products are pregnancy safe and organically sourced.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: We have paypal, card payment and shop payment for customers on our website at checkout.&nbsp;</p>",
